---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use — Seddly">
  <section class="legal">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="effective">Effective Date: March 23, 2026</p>

    <p>These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your use of the Seddly mobile application ("App") provided by Pearson Media LLC ("we," "us," "our").</p>

    <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>By downloading, installing, or using the App, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the App.</p>

    <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
    <p>Seddly is a personal accountability tool that extracts commitments, deadlines, and monetary amounts from screenshots using on-device text recognition and AI-powered analysis. The App is designed for personal use and informational purposes only.</p>

    <h2>3. Not Legal Advice</h2>
    <p>Seddly is not a legal tool, legal service, or substitute for legal advice. Commitment timelines, dispute summaries, and extracted data are informational and may support your personal records, but they do not constitute legal evidence, legal documentation, or legal advice. Consult a licensed attorney for legal matters.</p>

    <h2>4. Subscriptions and Billing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The App offers free and paid subscription tiers (Pro and Pro+).</li>
      <li>Subscriptions are billed through the Apple App Store and are subject to Apple's terms and conditions.</li>
      <li>Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing period.</li>
      <li>You can manage and cancel subscriptions in your iPhone Settings &gt; [Your Name] &gt; Subscriptions.</li>
      <li>Refunds are handled by Apple per their refund policy.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. User Responsibilities</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You are responsible for the accuracy of manually entered commitments.</li>
      <li>You acknowledge that AI-powered extraction may produce errors, and you are responsible for reviewing and correcting extracted data.</li>
      <li>You will not use the App for surveillance, harassment, or any purpose that violates applicable law.</li>
      <li>You will not attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or tamper with the App.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>The App, including its design, code, and content, is owned by Pearson Media LLC and is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws. Your commitment data belongs to you.</p>

    <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Pearson Media LLC shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the App. Our total liability shall not exceed the amount you paid for the App in the 12 months preceding the claim.</p>

    <h2>8. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
    <p>The App is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. We do not guarantee the accuracy of AI-powered commitment extraction, deadline detection, or entity identification.</p>

    <h2>9. Termination</h2>
    <p>We may terminate or suspend your access to the App at any time for violation of these Terms. You may stop using the App at any time by uninstalling it.</p>

    <h2>10. Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the App after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>

    <h2>11. Governing Law</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the United States. Any disputes arising from these Terms shall be resolved in the courts of the state where Pearson Media LLC is incorporated.</p>

    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about these Terms, contact us at:<br/>
      <a href="mailto:legal@seddly.com">legal@seddly.com</a><br/>
      Pearson Media LLC</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem;
  }

  .legal h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .effective {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .legal p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal ul {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
